## Neue Datapack Struktur:

# Datapack Strucktur:
# (+) = Neu
# (>) = Bearbeiten
# (-) = Entfernen
# (*) = Alt/Vorhanden
* Main
    * data
        * quests_dorf1
            * function
                * init
                    > init_scoreboards_all.mcfunction
                * dialoge
                    + dorfwaechter
                        + dialog_dorfwaechter.mcfcuntion
                        + dialog1_dorfwaechter.mcfcuntion
                * waechter
                    * patrolie
                        > interaction_waechter.mcfunction
                        + interaction_waechter_sub.mcfunction



